      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating API File Creation**\n\nI'm now focused on the initial Python file, `embed_text.py`, and how I'll leverage Google's embeddings API within it. The immediate goal is to establish the core functionality for text embedding, prioritizing the primary request. Other files will be created as empty templates, which is a key next step.\n\n\n**Developing Core Embedding Script**\n\nI've made progress on `embed_text.py`, the main script. It will now incorporate the Google embeddings API using the `generativeai` library. I've ensured a model is specified. As planned, the other nine Python files are now in place as empty templates, ready for future expansion as this project advances. I am on the correct path.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789843073737,
          "start": 1789843072761
